PRINTFORML A zashiki-warashi who works as a waitress at the Geidontei Pub, and the main protagonist of Lotus Eaters.
PRINTFORML A very emotional person, she is perceived by the public as cheerful and friendly.
PRINTFORML However, she also has a mischievous side, in which she inebriates her patrons, induces hallucinations and
PRINTFORML nightmares, plants false memories, and makes people forget certain events.
PRINTFORML At one point, she possessed the Ibuki Gourd without permission to see the world outside of the pub, attempting to
PRINTFORML party all over the place, but later she made a deal with Suika to let her stay in the Gourd whenever she wants,
PRINTFORML in exchange for the little oni enjoying the services of the pub late at night.
